  },
  {
    "id": 4001034040160,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……運……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400103404/4001034040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どんなに気持ちを汲もうとしたって、\r\n外れる時は外れるだろうしさ",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それはもう自分ではどうにもできないだろ？\r\nだからめげずに、根気よく繰り返すっていうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ドンマイ、次！　って思える気持ちも\r\n大事なんじゃないかなぁと思うよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001034040170,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400103404/4001034040170"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001034040180,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……長引けば長引くほど、\r\n泥沼になったりしないですかねー",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400103404/4001034040180"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001034040190,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……お互いのこと、わかってないんだなぁ、\r\nみたいな……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400103404/4001034040190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──なるほど\r\nそういう捉え方もあるか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001034040200,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400103404/4001034040200"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……──俺はさ、気楽にやってもらえたらいいなって\r\n思ってるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『あーそうか\r\nこの人はこういう時、こんなふうに答えるんだぁ』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──とか、そういう体験でもしに行くようなつもりで",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今までの仲の良さを試されるテストとしてじゃなくて\r\nもっと相手を知るための授業として楽しんでもらえたらって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんな感じで捉えるのはどうだろう？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001034040210,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……なるほどー",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400103404/4001034040210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今ので納得してもらえそうか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001034040220,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "んー……\r\n半々な感じはしますねー",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400103404/4001034040220"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001034040230,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "そうは言っても気にしそうだし──あ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400103404/4001034040230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか\r\n摩美々は誰かのために聞いてくれたんだな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001034040240,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……やめてくださいー\r\n別に、そういうのじゃないんで",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400103404/4001034040240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "や、すまん……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……でも、やっぱり俺はさ\r\nそういう優しい摩美々がいる、アンティーカは",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "たとえ答えが揃わなかったとしても\r\n楽しんでほしいと思うんだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "知らなかったことがあったって\r\n今知ればいいだけなんだ、って──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001034040250,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "だからぁ\r\nそういうのじゃないんでー",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
